5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about programs failing in year two due to unstable agreements. We must check our history.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. I want to see what previous trials actually achieved before we commit more resources.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know where the pressure is. Rosters decide if a program survives or collapses.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am concerned about the hidden costs. I need to see the actual ledger and tariff structures.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am worried about the physical space. Can our rooms and parking handle another influx of patients?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, please look into the board minutes. I suspect the joint clinic agreement was never fully signed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will review the readmission figures. If patients return, the program failed its core purpose.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will check the ward nursing vacancies. If we are already short-staffed, adding a program is dangerous.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will examine the development allocation and the regional fund tariffs. I need to know the real numbers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the rooms and parking coverage. I also want to see what the booking system records.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Misaki, if the staffing is thin, we cannot rely on external bodies to fill the gaps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. We need hard data on patient outcomes, not just promises of future care.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also look at the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I need to see the surplus areas.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the data agreements with outside surgeries. I want to see where the money leaks.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the visit completion on the shared nursing round. I need to see the daily flow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let us gather these facts. I want to ensure we do not repeat the mistakes of the last cycle.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the readmission data. It is the clearest measure of whether a program works.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the staffing records. I need to see where the teams are already stretched.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will focus on the financial records. I need to see the true cost of running these programs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will focus on the physical capacity. I need to see if the building can breathe under the new load.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
